      "describe_ch": "具備推演及解決基本電機工程相關題目或問題的知識能力。\t",
      "describe_en": "Possess the knowledge to derive and resolve fundamental electrical engineering related topics or problems."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "理解基本定理及熟悉其設計方法。\t",
      "describe_en": "Comprehend the fundamental principles and familiar with its design methods."
    }
